e if we can figure  out how to do it but one Democratic  lawmaker who represents a district Trump  one doesn't see Pelosi as a liability I  don't think anybody on the Democratic  side of the aisle is is interested and a  bunch of upheaval at this point just a  few minutes ago Mulvaney's spokeswoman  emailed me to say that he was speaking  hypothetical hypothetically this weekend  and  is not working behind the scenes to oust  Ryan and if you look at the numbers  right now there is a reason that nobody  is publicly calling for a speaker's  election that is because nobody has  believed to have the votes to replace  him right now including McCarthy there  are still multiple factions of  Republicans that are gonna want  something in exchange for their support  to help him win a majority of the house  breath fascinating Peter Doocy live on  the hill Peter thank you

